{"t":"MARA","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"MARA Holdings, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","employees":266,"hq":"Hallandale Beach, FL, United States","website":"https://www.mara.com","summary_en":"MARA Holdings, Inc. operates as an energy and digital infrastructure company in North America, the Middle East, Europe, and Latin America. The company leverages Bitcoin Mining and Artificial Intelligence compute to monetize excess energy and underutilized power, optimize power management across operations and support AI inference applications. The company was formerly known as Marathon Digital Holdings, Inc. and changed its name to MARA Holdings, Inc. in August 2024. MARA Holdings, Inc. was incorporated in 2010 and is based in Hallandale Beach, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"MARA Holdings, Inc.는 북미, 중동, 유럽 및 라틴 아메리카에서 에너지 및 디지털 인프라 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 이 회사는 비트코인 ​​마이닝 및 인공 지능 컴퓨팅을 활용하여 초과 에너지와 활용도가 낮은 전력으로 수익을 창출하고 운영 전반에 걸쳐 전력 관리를 최적화하며 AI 추론 애플리케이션을 지원합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Marathon Digital Holdings, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2024년 8월에 MARA Holdings, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. MARA Holdings, Inc.는 2010년에 법인화되었으며 플로리다주 할렌데일 비치에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":5.58,"mcap":2161727744.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-9.24867,"peg":null,"ps":3.0189958,"pb":0.917009,"ev_ebitda":-2.498,"div":0.0,"beta":5.253,"hi52":16.43,"lo52":5.04},"fin":{"rev":716041984.0,"rev_g":-0.349,"eps_g":3.823,"gross":0.32624,"op":-3.3550298,"net":0.0,"roe":-0.77409,"fcf":-1039569472.0,"cash":946545024.0,"debt":3079822080.0,"de":125.679,"eps":-8.83,"feps":-0.60333},"own":{"short":0.3334,"inst":0.75841004,"insider":0.00723},"analyst":{"n":13,"mean":15.76308,"median":14.92,"high":27.0,"low":9.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.13333,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":7,"hold":4,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3